      "text": "status: approved   # by the operator, 2026-11-20, in a session, after the draft pull request (#794) was shown: \"131 is approved\". No Council has read this text (the Councils t_0002 to t_0004 could not use a Gemini seat; the cause is this spec's subject), so the approval rests on the operator reading the draft and the evidence in section 1. Open decisions take their recommendations unless the operator says otherwise. Spec 128's slices S4 and S5 here still wait for 128 to be built."
